before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
import java.nio.file.*;
public class Main {

  public static void main(String[] args) throws java.io.IOException {
    Path path = Path.of("notes.txt");
    Files.writeString(path, "A");
    Files.writeString(path, "B", StandardOpenOption.APPEND);
    System.out.println(Files.readString(path));
  }
}
```

after:
If running locally, use a new practice folder: this code replaces any notes.txt in its working folder. Follow the two writes in order.

